## the dose answer, stated as a comparison, not an interpretation
rungs shared with the step-799 boundary: 128/1024/4096.
step 799 (throttled):  0.150 (9/60)  0.217 (13/60)  0.183 (11/60)
step 1199 (unthrottled): 0.150 (9/60) 0.217 (13/60) 0.183 (11/60)
Identical correct-counts on all three shared rungs after 400 more updates. Two different
checkpoints agreeing exactly on three 60-sample counts is not what a learner still moving looks
like; it is what a collapsed readout looks like, and the training loss agrees -- ema 1.791 at
step 1199 against ln(6) = 1.791759469228055.

